        f"Cumulative reference accounting: **{total_starts} verifier starts, {result['cumulative_reference']['completed_native_calls']} completed native calls and {generations} generation starts**, including the interrupted old run, discarded old Confidence reports and replacement. Ceilings255/372 were not exceeded. One original Confidence outcome/duration remains unknown; it is never fabricated or counted as a usable result.",'',
        'Arithmetic Rule-singleton and factual Evidence-singleton policies and their completed reserved evaluations remain frozen. Compound retains its frozen Evidence+Rule pair, with **45/48 reserved decisions, zero errors and three uncertainties**. Its85% development gate was explicitly chosen after seeing development; the original90% infeasibility artifact is unchanged. Compound equals the matching fixed plan under every simulated attack; no strategic superiority is demonstrated.','',
