        'The [scoped E/R adapter](../scripts/scoped_er_adapter.py), [transfer](../artifacts/remaining-category-studies-v1/scoped-er-v1/transfer.json), [reserved results](../artifacts/remaining-category-studies-v1/scoped-er-v1/reserved-results.json) and [cluster intervals](../artifacts/remaining-category-studies-v1/scoped-er-v1/uncertainty-supplement.json) retain completed compound evidence. E/R projection ID is `310364dae8d9d6c001622d4bbe1866ca0646fb8f50c9c50a022e05f5353688c1`. Evidence uses local regex/template ClaimGenerator, embeddings, corpus/index retrieval and NLI; Rule is local. Scoped execution constructs neither Confidence nor Ollama and forbids network. Actual96 calls/0 generations completed without service dependence.','',
